# J. Jonah Jameson: "When J. Jonah Jameson enters, suspect up to one target creature." Bot1 targets Bot2's Memnite, which becomes suspected (menace, can't block, CR 701.60c). When it attacks on turn 4 it does not trigger JJJ's second ability, which is only for creatures Bot1 controls: Bot1 makes no Treasure.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
J. Jonah Jameson
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.J. Jonah Jameson.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = CantBlock; Menace
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield = J. Jonah Jameson; Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
